# Cursor Editor — Composer & Keyboard Shortcuts

## Overview

The **Composer** is Cursor's primary interaction surface. It is the interface through which developers communicate with the AI agent to edit code, ask questions, generate files, and manage project tasks. The Composer has two distinct entry points:

- **Inline Edit** (Cmd+K / Ctrl+K): Modifies selected text in the current file
- **Side Panel Chat** (Cmd+L / Ctrl+L): Full conversation with access to all project context

The Composer differs from standard editor chat panels by automatically including rich contextual information (selected code, open files, file paths, @-references) and by executing edits directly in the editor rather than just generating text in a chat bubble.

---

## Keyboard Shortcuts

### Core Shortcuts

| Shortcut | Platform | Action | Description |
|----------|----------|--------|-------------|
| `Cmd+K` / `Ctrl+K` | Mac / Windows | Open Inline Edit | Opens Composer inline in the editor at cursor position |
| `Cmd+L` / `Ctrl+L` | Mac / Windows | Open Side Panel Chat | Opens Composer in the sidebar for full conversation |
| `Cmd+Enter` / `Ctrl+Enter` | Mac / Windows | Submit Prompt | Sends the current prompt in any Composer panel |
| `Escape` | All | Dismiss Composer | Closes the Composer panel inline or in side panel |
| `Cmd+Shift+K` / `Ctrl+Shift+K` | Mac / Windows | New Composer Tab | Opens a fresh inline edit prompt |
| `Tab` | All | Accept Completion | Accepts Tab autocompletion suggestion |
| `Ctrl+Right` / `Cmd+Right` | Mac / Windows | Accept Next Word | Accepts the next word in the completion |

### Inline Edit Shortcuts (Active in Inline Prompt)

| Shortcut | Action |
|----------|--------|
| `Cmd+Enter` | Submit the inline edit prompt |
| `Cmd+Z` | Undo the last generated edit |
| `Escape` | Cancel the inline edit without applying changes |
| Arrow Up | Navigate through the current file context |

### Side Panel Shortcuts

| Shortcut | Action |
|----------|--------|
| `Cmd+Shift+N` | New Composer chat session |
| `Cmd+Shift+G` | Generate commit message |
| `Cmd+Shift+H` | Open history sidebar |
| `Cmd+Shift+F` | Search codebase |

