## Composer Settings

The following Cursor settings control Composer behavior:

```json
{
  // Enable or disable inline completions
  "editor.tabAutocompletion": true,
  
  // Composer panel position
  "workbench.panel.defaultLocation": "right",
  
  // Enable Composer history
  "cursor.history.enabled": true,
  
  // Auto-include context settings
  "cursor.context.includeOpenFiles": true,
  "cursor.context.includeSelectedCode": true
}
```

